{"info":{"name":"formly-prize-engine","description":"API v1. Flujo: 1 Create Prize → 2 Get Prize → 3 Create Prize USDC → 4 Payment Intent → 5 Verify payment (consulta vault_deposits; polling guarda datos) → 6-7 Pay. Variables: baseUrl, serviceToken, prizeId.","schema":"https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"},"variable":[{"key":"baseUrl","value":"http://localhost:3000"},{"key":"serviceToken","value":""},{"key":"prizeId","value":""}],"item":[{"name":"1. Create Prize (POINTS)","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{serviceToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"rewardType\": \"POINTS\",\n  \"distributionMode\": \"SPLIT_EQUAL\",\n  \"prizeAmount\": \"60.0000000\",\n  \"closeAt\": \"2025-03-01T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"drawAt\": \"2025-03-02T12:00:00.000Z\"\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes"},"description":"Crea un prize POINTS. Copia prizeId a la variable de colección."},{"name":"2. Get Prize","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{serviceToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes/{{prizeId}}"},"description":"Obtiene el prize. Necesitas prizeId en la variable."},{"name":"3. Create Prize (USDC)","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{serviceToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"rewardType\": \"USDC\",\n  \"distributionMode\": \"LOTTERY_SINGLE\",\n  \"prizeAmount\": \"100.0000000\",\n  \"feeBps\": 1000,\n  \"closeAt\": \"2025-03-01T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"drawAt\": \"2025-03-02T12:00:00.000Z\"\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes"},"description":"Crea prize USDC (queda AWAITING_PAYMENT_CONFIRMATION)."},{"name":"4. Create Payment Intent","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{serviceToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"creatorPublicKey\": \"GCT7D6S5VTFGEURS6ZYIO33YZRPQMA3LNWB4GEOHDFDXZGWTA4EPIM5E\"\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes/{{prizeId}}/payment-intent"},"description":"Genera Payment Intent (unsigned XDR). El core firma y envía la XDR a Stellar."},{"name":"5. Verify payment","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{serviceToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes/{{prizeId}}/verify-payment"},"description":"Consulta vault_deposits (rellenada por polling). Body {} o {\"txHash\":\"...\"}. Si hay depósito válido, marca LOCKED."},{"name":"6. Pay to wallet (LOTTERY_SINGLE)","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{serviceToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"destinations\": [\n    \"GCT7D6S5VTFGEURS6ZYIO33YZRPQMA3LNWB4GEOHDFDXZGWTA4EPIM5E\"\n  ]\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes/{{prizeId}}/pay"},"description":"Una wallet: todo el prize_net a esa dirección. LOTTERY_SINGLE acepta solo 1 destino. Premio debe estar LOCKED o CLOSED."},{"name":"7. Pay to wallet (SPLIT_EQUAL)","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{serviceToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"destinations\": [\n    \"GCT7D6S5VTFGEURS6ZYIO33YZRPQMA3LNWB4GEOHDFDXZGWTA4EPIM5E\",\n    \"GDNTD6PR3P3Q7HYMJXFCJT75BQR2NXUGR3TUKMMLETUTHIMEWGF6TD3U\"\n  ]\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes/{{prizeId}}/pay"},"description":"Varias wallets: prize_net repartido a partes iguales. Requiere PRIZE_VAULT_SECRET_KEY."}]}
